{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46223","headline":"贺雨上王使君二首 二 · 贯休","name":"贺雨上王使君二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"由来天赞德唯馨，朋祷心期事尽行。\n玄妙久闻谈佛母，感通今日见神明。\n破除秋热飘萧尽，还似春时散漫倾。\n他日爲霖亦如此，诸生无不沐经营。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46223.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46223","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}